  "reasoning": "The defendants knowingly used a pseudo‑base‑station to send large numbers of SMS messages that impersonated banks and offered false credit‑card upgrades or cash‑redeeming offers. The content was fraudulent and intended to deceive recipients, which constitutes fraud. The method employed a telecommunications device, but the core criminal conduct is the fraudulent communication for illicit gain, i.e., \"利用信息网络实施诈骗罪\". No other distinct criminal conduct (such as illegal possession of telecom equipment) is separately charged in the facts. Therefore the appropriate charge is fraud.",
